title: Taskip Public API
description: >-
  Explore the Taskip Public API to integrate CRM, projects, tasks, and workflows
  into your apps. Learn authentication, endpoints, and how to automate processes
  with clear examples.
sidebar:
  order: 0
---
Taskip API lets you connect external apps with your workspace to manage clients, projects, tasks, billing, and reporting from one system. You can create an API application from your dashboard, generate a secure key, and use it to authenticate requests and automate workflows or build custom integrations.

View full documentation - [https://public-api-doc.taskip.net/](https://public-api-doc.taskip.net/)
